      Spire of Industry: pays {C} only: its other colours come with a condition this engine cannot see.
      Urza's Saga: makes mana for three turns, the one it is played on and the two after: its last chapter sacrifices it.
      Wooded Foothills: a fetchland, read as the untapped lands it can find in this deck (Forest, Mountain, Taiga, Tropical Island, Volcanic Island): pays {U}{R}{G}, assuming one is still in the library to find.
